refSeqs-Reference file of sequences present within the dataset
Columns: Segment #, Protein Sequence, DNA Sequence

Count-Raw counts of each sequence from the NGS for each sorted bin
Percentage-Raw percentages of each sequences from NGS for each sorted bin

Column naming convention:
G# = GASright bin number
L# = Left bin number
R# = Right bin number
Bin numbers in ascending order correspond to increasing fluorescence intensity bins
Rep# = Replicate number
LB = Luria Broth Growth sample
M9 = Maltose Broth Growth sample
#H = # of hours of growth